---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---
<Layout title="About" description="How Great Software works — an independent software studio across products, client work, and agentic systems consulting.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-24 pb-16">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent mb-4">About the studio</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight">A whole range of software.</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-5 text-lg text-muted">
      <p>{site.name} is an independent software studio, founded on a simple idea: instead of betting everything on one product, take on a broad range of work and hold all of it to one standard — software that actually works in the real world.</p>
      <p>The work spans three kinds. Its own products, built and run in-house. Client and consulting builds, including agentic systems and orchestration. And research — some of it never ships, but it sharpens the next thing.</p>
      <p>The common thread isn't a single product or a single market. It's range, and the craft to do each kind of work well.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl mt-16 mb-6">The work</h2>
    <ul class="flex flex-col gap-6 list-none m-0 p-0">
      <li>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">agentic systems &amp; orchestration</span>
        <div class="text-muted mt-1">Design, build, and tuning for AI agents and the workflows that coordinate them, so they hold up in production rather than just demo well. Backed by a multi-agent platform already running real businesses — daily practice, not theory.</div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">product &amp; client builds</span>
        <div class="text-muted mt-1">From first prototype to shipped software. Some of it runs in-house; some is designed and handed off cleanly.</div>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl mt-16 mb-6">How it works</h2>
    <ol class="flex flex-col gap-6 list-none m-0 p-0">
      <li><span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">01 · build</span><div class="text-muted mt-1">Start from the actual problem. Pick the smallest thing that proves the idea, then make it real.</div></li>
      <li><span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">02 · ship</span><div class="text-muted mt-1">Put it in front of real users and real load. Refine the flows people touch most.</div></li>
      <li><span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">03 · support</span><div class="text-muted mt-1">Stand behind it. Keep measuring, keep improving, or hand it off cleanly.</div></li>
    </ol>

    <p class="mt-12 font-mono text-sm">
      <a href="/contact" class="text-accent">Get in touch →</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
